# (1.4.0) a Set's hand-over into a piece whose Intro is None (it starts in its main): a Mix enters it as it enters a
# piece with an intro, the kick on the downbeat, the noise from it, the bass a bar on, the chord, the pings and the
# hats two, each fader rising to full, none full at once and dipping under the ramp (as they did: 1.0 on the downbeat,
# 0.0 two bars on, 1.0 again at four); then its main. A Segue's: the piece whole from its downbeat, as PLAY has it
listen
wait 1500
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 28
spin K1 2
wait 300
expect par158 2
spin K2 2
wait 300
expect trans 2
# three short songs: the sixth piece (Intro None), the seventh (Intro None), the eighth (Intro 16 bars)
turn PRESET 7
wait 600
expect piece 7
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K1 -10
spin K1 2
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect par159 2
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
expect piece 6
spin K1 -10
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect par159 0
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
expect piece 5
spin K1 -10
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect par159 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
tap PLAY
wait 300
trwatch
# the sixth's outro's last bar about 94 s on (48 bars at 126); the seventh's first 8 bars (16 s at 120)
wait 112000
expect piece 6
expect song 2
expect trrestarts 1
expect trdip 0
expect trjump <10
expect trkick <2
expect trbass >15
expect trchord >31
expect trquiet <2000
# (step 5b's path: the held echo's repeats of a stab thrown before the end, a dotted 8th apart, read 81-85)
expect trclick <110
# the seventh (48 bars at 120, 96 s) into the eighth, its intro: the same entry
wait 96000
expect piece 7
expect song 1
expect trrestarts 2
expect trdip 0
expect trjump <10
expect trkick <2
expect trbass >15
expect trchord >31
# a Segue into Intro None: no dip, the parts whole from the downbeat
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 300
spin K2 -1
wait 300
expect trans 1
turn PRESET -2
wait 600
expect piece 5
tap PLAY
wait 300
trwatch
wait 112000
expect piece 6
expect song 2
expect trrestarts 1
expect trdip 0
expect trjump >990
expect trquiet <2000
expect trclick <80
